OL,3,GNEWSAWoman, 80, dies after being set
OL,4,Aalight outside her home
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 80-year-old woman who was set on
OL,7,Ffire outside her own home has died.
OL,9,FHertfordshire Police said Brenda
OL,10,FRaymond suffered catastrophic injuries
OL,11,Fin an attack involving an accelerant in
OL,12,Fthe first-floor communal area of
OL,13,FCaractacus Cottage View, a block of
OL,14,Fflats in Watford, on 9 November.
OL,16,FShe was admitted to hospital where she
OL,17,Fremained in a critical condition. The
OL,18,Fpolice confirmed that she died on
OL,19,FWednesday morning.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,372,370,200,160,0,100
