OL,3,GNEWSAWoman, 80, dies after being set
OL,4,Aalight outside her home
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Insp Adam Bridges said: "Her death
OL,7,Fis now being treated as murder and we
OL,8,Fcontinue to work hard to understand the
OL,9,Fcircumstances of what happened to her."
